### GET actions
GET http://0.0.0.0:8080/master-control/actions
Accept: application/json

### Obtener acción por ID
GET http://0.0.0.0:8080/master-control/actions/open_vscode
Accept: application/json

### Ejecutar VSCode
POST http://0.0.0.0:8080/master-control/actions/open_vscode/execute

### Eliminar acción
DELETE http://0.0.0.0:8080/master-control/actions/open_vscode

### Crear una acción tipo command
POST http://0.0.0.0:8080/master-control/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "open_vscode",
  "label": "Abrir VSCode",
  "icon": "vscode.png",
  "type": "command",
  "command": "open -a 'Visual Studio Code'"
}


### Crear una acción tipo AppleScript (ctrl+tab)
POST http://0.0.0.0:8080/master-control/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "next_tab",
  "label": "Next Tab",
  "icon": "tab.png",
  "type": "applescript",
  "command": "tell application \"System Events\" to key code 48 using control down"
}

### Crear acción scroll simple (flecha abajo repetida)
POST http://0.0.0.0:8080/master-control/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "scroll_down",
  "label": "Scroll Down",
  "icon": "scroll.png",
  "type": "applescript",
  "command": "repeat 10 times tell application \\\"System Events\\\" to key code 125 end repeat"
}